D='D:/SpaceBook/SpaceBook Web/docs/source-verification/class-6/eng/pages/'
def add(page, prefix, sol):
    f=D+f'p{page}.txt'; L=open(f,encoding='utf8').read().split('\n')
    i=next(k for k,l in enumerate(L) if l.startswith(prefix))
    assert not L[i+1].startswith('sol'), page
    L.insert(i+1,sol)
    open(f,'w',encoding='utf8',newline='\n').write('\n'.join(L))
add('013','q 6','sol The topic sentence is the first sentence: "Hazrat Muhammad (ﷺ) taught love, kindness and compassion to his people." ## It states the main idea of the paragraph; the later sentences (loving, gentle, compassionate; the Quran quotation) support it with specific words (love, kindness, compassion), vivid verbs (taught) and modifiers (most loving, gentle). || موضوعی جملہ پہلا جملہ ہے: "حضرت محمد ﷺ نے اپنے لوگوں کو محبت، مہربانی اور ہمدردی سکھائی۔" یہ پیراگراف کا مرکزی خیال بتاتا ہے۔')
add('028','q 1 | Consult a dictionary','sol charitable - giving help freely to those in need; poverty - the state of being very poor; sailed - travelled on water in a ship or boat; missionaries - people sent to spread a religion or give aid; humanity - all people, or kindness towards others; acknowledged - accepted or recognised as true or valuable; soviet - relating to the former USSR; decree - an official order; honorary - given as an honour without the usual requirements; compassion - sympathy and concern for the suffering of others ## Meanings from a standard dictionary; the transcriptions are printed in the table. || ہر لفظ کے معنی معیاری لغت سے؛ تلفظ جدول میں چھپے ہیں۔')
add('088','q 2 | Read the text','sol peace = a state without war (used in "The white background symbolizes peace and truth"); piece = a creation or part (used in "This is the piece I want to be played"); where = asks about place ("Where can we find the original stadium?"); were = plural past of "be" ("The Olympic Games were completely forgotten") ## Homophones sound the same but differ in spelling and meaning. || ہم آواز الفاظ: peace/piece اور where/were کے معنی اوپر دیے گئے ہیں۔')
add('081','q 2 | Listen to the classroom','sol The audio is the classroom conversation printed in the box; the exercises that follow (question 3) are answered below: the topic is the benefits of doing sport; Group B names lower blood pressure and diabetes risk; Group D names stronger bones; sport also improves mood and concentration. ## Listening task: the answers come from the conversation text. || آڈیو وہی کلاس گفتگو ہے جو باکس میں چھپی ہے؛ سوال 3 کے جواب نیچے دیے گئے ہیں۔')
add('011','q 1 | Read the words with their meanings','sol Read the table: the words and their meanings are already given (foster-mother, widow, proposal, orphan, AD, slave); no answer is to be written. ## A reading task for understanding the vocabulary of the lesson. || یہ پڑھنے کی مشق ہے؛ الفاظ اور ان کے معنی جدول میں دیے گئے ہیں۔')
add('018','q 1 | Read the passage given below','sol Match the words in bold with their meanings; the matching is given in the answer to question 2 below. ## Question 1 introduces the matching task of question 2. || الفاظ کا ملاپ نیچے سوال 2 کے جواب میں دیا گیا ہے۔')
